AB  - The development of quantum computers becomes a threat to current cryptosystems including RSA and ECDSA, and hence to blockchain and IoT security. This work introduces a Hybrid Dual-Signature Scheme (HDSS) blending Falcon and Sphincs+ signatures with higher quantum resistance against quantum adversaries. We present the theoretical construction of HDSS and provide preliminary experimental indications using small-scale datasets. Full benchmarking, system quantification, and deployment in blockchain/IoT are left as future work. Β© 2025 IEEE.
