TI  - A Comprehensive Review of Blockchain based E-Voting Technologies and Challenges
PY  - 2025
T2  - 3rd International Conference on Electronics and Renewable Systems, ICEARS 2025 - Proceedings
SP  - 1035
EP  - 1040
DO  - 10.1109/ICEARS64219.2025.10940076
