TI  - Trilemma-resilient blockchain design: Integrating storage proofs, adaptive sharding, and hybrid encoding
PY  - 2026
T2  - Computers and Electrical Engineering
VL  - 134
C7  - 111145
DO  - 10.1016/j.compeleceng.2026.111145
