TI  - A Hybrid Decision Tree and Random Forest Model for DDoS Attack Detection and Mitigation in the Internet of Vehicles with Enhanced Data Privacy
PY  - 2026
T2  - Recent Patents on Engineering
VL  - 20
IS  - 7
DO  - 10.2174/0118722121418032251125064501
